**Reference analysis:**
- 4 corner towers (square, tall) with crenellations on top
- One tower (back-left) is taller — the keep
- Connecting walls between all towers, lower than towers, also with crenellations
- Arched gate on the front wall with a drawbridge/ramp extending outward
- Small dark windows on the towers
- Overall gray/stone color scheme

**Current code issues:**
1. No drawbridge/ramp (prominent in reference)
2. Gate arch is just a small cylinder — needs proper arch opening
3. Walls are too thin and not clearly separated from towers
4. Crenellations are overly numerous and cluttered
5. No height difference for the keep tower
6. Windows are tiny and poorly positioned

